  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 16 + 24 × 12 - 25 ÷ 6 = 312 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 25 and 24\n\nGiven statement : 16 + 24 × 12 - 25 ÷ 6 = 312 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n16 + 25 × 12 - **24 ÷ 6**__ = 312 \n\n16 + __**25 × 12**__ - 4 = 312\n\n__**16 + 300**__ - 4 = 312\n\n__**316 - 4**__ = 312\n\n312 = 312 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 25 and 12 \n\nGiven statement : 16 + 24 × 12 - 25 ÷ 6 = 312 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n16 + 24 × 25 - **12 ÷ 6**__ = 312 \n\n16 + __**24 × **____**25**__ - 2 = 312\n\n__**16 + 600**__ - 2 = 312\n\n__**616 - 2**__ = 312\n\n614 ≠ 312 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 25 and 16\n\nGiven statement : 16 + 24 × 12 - 25 ÷ 6 = 312 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n25 + 24 × 12 - **16 ÷ 6**__ = 312 \n\n25 + __**24 × 12**__ - 2.67 = 312\n\n__**25 + 288**__ - 2.67 = 312\n\n__**313 - 2.67**__ = 312\n\n310.33 ≠ 312 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 24 and 16\n\nGiven statement : 16 + 24 × 12 - 25 ÷ 6 = 312\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n24 + 16 × 12 - **25 ÷ 6**__ = 312 \n\n24 + __**16**____** × 12**__ - 4.17 = 312\n\n__**24 + 192**__ - 4.17 = 312\n\n__**216 - 4.17**__ = 312\n\n211.83 ≠ 312 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
